              "desc": "· <color=#FFFFFF>Ultimate</color> DMG <color=#2BAD00>increases</color> by 30%. When launching <color=#FFFFFF>Ultimate</color>, the Agent's ATK <color=#2BAD00>increases</color> by 15% for 15s. Repeated triggers reset the duration.\n· After enemies become Stunned, their Stun DMG Multiplier <color=#2BAD00>increases by 35%</color>."
