            "69012703": {
              "title": "Focus Energy",
              "desc": "· Agent ATK <color=#2BAD00>increases by 16%</color>, and enemy Stun DMG Multiplier <color=#2BAD00>increases by 30%</color>.\n· When in Ether Veil, Agent attacks that hit enemies ignore <color=#2BAD00>10%</color> of <color=#F0D12B>Physical RES</color> and <color=#2BAD00>15%</color> of DEF."
